# Local eval run history (evals/history.py) -- a rolling local log of
# `make eval` invocations, not meaningful shared history across machines;
# a real deployment sends this to a metrics backend instead.
evals/history/

# Terraform. .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT committed here (even
# though it usually should be) -- CI's `terraform init` resolves fresh on
# every run rather than reusing a committed lock file, and a lock file
# generated on one OS only records that platform's provider hashes,
# causing the exact cross-platform mismatch class of bug
# requirements.lock.txt hit in Phase 10 (see docs/PROGRESS.md). Revisit
# once there's a reason to pin providers for real (a `terraform apply`
# against a real account).
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# CycloneDX SBOM (make sbom) -- a per-build artifact (see docs/RUNBOOK.md
# and Makefile's `sbom` target comment), not source; CI produces it fresh
# per run as a build artifact instead.
sbom.json
